{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:00.30]G-Money just bought a pound of the Gushers, we've been smokin' exotic product (Countin' this cash until I have an out of body)\n[00:07.24]G-Money just bought a pound of the Gushers, we've been smokin' exotic product (Countin' this cash until I have an out of body)\n[00:10.98]Modern-day rockstar, I feel like Ozzy, honestly (Okay)\n[00:12.82]G-Money just bought a pound of the Gushers, we've been smokin', yeah\n[Chorus]\n[00:17.30]G-Money just bought a pound of the Gushers, we've been smokin' exotic product (Woah, woah, woah, woah, slatt, slatt)\n[00:21.56]Was robbin' and juggin' with roadrunners, every day whippin', keeping the stove jumpin' (Exotic product)\n[00:25.36]I just went and found me some Actavis, I've been havin' an out of body\n[00:28.46]I grew up sippin' green, I was on one, I remember the first day the purple comin' (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, out of body)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:33.88]I get so high I panic, off of the medi—cine need a medic, medic (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[00:37.10]These hoes, I'm not entertainin', fuck up my sanity\n[00:39.40]I'm too busy counting the fetty (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[00:41.06]We keep them guns on us, you know we war-ready\n[00:42.92]My gun sing like Mariah, so I love to Carey it\n[00:45.30]If he talk out his neck, then his momma gon' bury 'em\n[00:47.14]If this bitch is a keeper, I'll take her then marry her\n[00:49.22]Fuck her friends in a Tahoe, the more is the merrier\n[00:51.50]There was Susie, and Anna, and Lisa, and Mary, or somethin'\n[00:54.02]I think her name Mary or somethin'?\n[00:55.44]But I couldn't tell if, you know I be high as a dummy\n[00:58.02]I don't take these Perky's for nothin'\n[00:59.44]Get so high it's embarrassin', that I don't be rememberin' names\n[01:02.38]But it's okay, don't matter how you play as long as you play the game, let's go!\n[Chorus]\n[01:06.18]G-Money just bought a pound of the Gushers, we've been smokin' exotic product (Exotic product)\n[01:10.44]Was robbin' and juggin' with roadrunners, every day whippin', keeping the stove jumpin'\n[01:14.76]I just went and found me some Actavis, I've been havin' an out of body (Out of body)\n[01:18.80]I grew up sippin' green, I was on one, I remember the first day the purple comin'\n[Verse 2]\n[01:21.42]Talkin' that lean talk, yeah (Talkin' that talk)\n[01:22.52]Talkin' that lean talk, yeah (Talkin' that talk)\n[01:27.08]Talkin' that perc talk, yeah (Kel-Tec chat)\n[01:29.38]Talkin' that bean talk, yeah (Kel-Tec talk)\n[01:31.20]Talkin' 'bout the scope on the rifle (Talk)\n[01:33.26]Choppa with a beam on, yeah (Kel-Tec talk)\n[01:35.30]Talkin' 'bout the bitch with a fat ol' ass (Talk) finna let 'em get up on it (Talk)\n[01:39.64]I'm livin' life like I'm Makaveli, wanna kill me then I got the MAC-11 (Slatt)\n[01:43.18]I got a bitch with her own money, and my bank got more green than a Packer's player (Slatt, slatt, slatt)\n[01:48.12]I'm livin' life like a cowboy with this Glizzy on me, no revolv' (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[01:51.56]I'm not ordinary, I can't go in the mall\n[01:53.40]Barney's private shoppin', one call (Uh-huh)\n[01:56.06]Phone call for my bros\n[01:58.02]They really miss me back home (Uh-huh)\n[01:59.84]All the hoes want dick from back home (Uh-huh)\n[02:02.00]They wasn't try to fuck me when I was broke (Uh-huh)\n[02:04.20]Now they want me to make time for 'em (Uh-huh)\n[02:06.04]Half of me sayin', \"Fuck it, give 'em consent forms\" (Uh-huh)\n[02:08.10]My main girl like a 911 new Porsche\n[02:09.86]And I ain't tryna smoke that one, no Newport\n[Chorus]\n[02:11.88]G-Money just bought a pound of the Gushers, we've been smokin' exotic product (Exotic product)\n[02:16.40]Was robbin' and juggin' with roadrunners, every day whippin', keeping the stove jumpin'\n[02:20.80]I just went and found me some Actavis, I've been havin' an out of body (Outer body)\n[02:24.78]I grew up sippin' green, I was on one, I remember the first day the purple comin'","w